   "he": "מַתְנִי׳ הַמְקַלֵּל אָבִיו וְאִמּוֹ אֵינוֹ חַיָּיב עַד שֶׁיְּקַלְּלֵם בַּשֵּׁם. קִלְּלָם בְּכִנּוּי, רַבִּי מֵאִיר מְחַיֵּיב וַחֲכָמִים פּוֹטְרִין.",
   "en": "«MISHNA:» «One who curses his father or his mother is not liable» to be executed by stoning «unless he curses them with the name» of God. If «he cursed them with an appellation» of the name of God, «Rabbi Meir deems» him «liable, and the Rabbis deem» him «exempt.»"
  }
